                "title": "Jamb Mounted 3/4 Inch Offset Pivot Set, ABH 0117.25",
                "description": "ABH 0117: These ABH 0117 3/4\" jamb mounted offset pivots are engineered for durability on interior doors weighing up to 300 pounds. Set includes top pivot, and bottom pivots with installation hardware. Available in 10 different finish colors.",
